('S1','U.S. Small Business Administration, Office of Advocacy','2025 Small Business Profiles / United States context','https://advocacy.sba.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/State_Profiles_2025_Technical-Notes.pdf','Supports the 36.2 million small-business context. Includes employer and nonemployer businesses. Search-indexed official profile consulted; direct PDF retrieval was blocked. Do not treat this total as OverHead’s addressable market.'),
